## Description

Congrats to @pablorpalafox, @PaarupLuis, @javipalafox, and @HappyRobot (S23) on their $150M Series C at a $1.2B valuation!  They build AI agents that run the phone calls, emails, and scheduling behind enterprise operations.  They proved the platform in logistics and are now https://t.co/fJfVxiYLwZ

